- New row: `T<n> | RDP audio | brainstorm | prod-codex, prod-fable | <scratch>/brainstorm/rdp-audio/joint.md | — | round 1 drafts | — | — | no`.

```bash
bash orchestrator/build-backlog.sh
```
Then the Artifact tool: update the same page path.

